{
  "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/wordmark.svg#gh-light-mode-only\" width=\"220\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Papilot\"><img src=\"docs/assets/wordmark-dark.svg#gh-dark-mode-only\" width=\"220\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Papilot\"><br>**Next-Generation AI LaTeX Editor**\n\n# Don't read or write `.tex`<br>Just work on the <img src=\"docs/assets/pdf.svg\" width=\"34\" height=\"41\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"PDF\">\n\nA **new paradigm** for responsible writing and typesetting with AI.\n\n<!-- BEGIN BADGES -->\n[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/github/license/PapilotAI/papilot?style=flat&color=22c55e)](LICENSE)\n[![CI](https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/PapilotAI/papilot/ci.yml?branch=main&style=flat&label=CI)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/actions/workflows/ci.yml)\n[![Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/PapilotAI/papilot?style=flat&label=release&color=0969da)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)\n[![GitHub total downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/PapilotAI/papilot/total?style=flat&logo=github&label=downloads&color=0969da)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases)\n[![npm monthly downloads](https://img.shields.io/npm/dm/papilot?style=flat&logo=npm&label=downloads&color=cb3837)](https://www.npmjs.com/package/papilot)\n<!-- END BADGES -->\n\n<p data-language-switcher><sub><a href=\"README.md\">English</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.zh-CN.md\">简体中文</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.zh-Hant.md\">繁體中文</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.ja.md\">日本語</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.ko.md\">한국어</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.de.md\">Deutsch</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.fr.md\">Français</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.es.md\">Español</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.pt.md\">Português</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.it.md\">Italiano</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.sv.md\">Svenska</a></sub></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai\">\n<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-compact-dark.png\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-dark.png\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-compact.png\">\n  <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero.png\" alt=\"Papilot shows an AI edit as a typeset before-and-after on the PDF, with Accept, Reject and Comment.\" width=\"900\">\n</picture>\n</a>\n</p>\n\n## 📄 You care about the PDF<br>Not the `.tex` behind it\n\nPapers, theses, books, slides: readers only ever see the typeset page.<br>\n**So the page is where you should work, too.**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-compact-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-compact.png\">\n    <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm.png\" alt=\"Writing LaTeX by hand, then checking LaTeX diffs from AI, and now Papilot: reviewing the PDF.\" width=\"900\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n**No more compiling diffs in your head.**<br>\nA source diff makes you *imagine* the PDF. Papilot *shows* it to you, typeset.\n\n## 👉 Point at the page and say what you want\n\nMark a sentence, an equation or a figure, and write a note.<br>\n**Your agent finds the source. You never open a `.tex` file.**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-compact-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-compact.png\">\n    <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app.png\" alt=\"Papilot with a box around an equation and a highlighted sentence on the PDF, each with a note, both added to the next task.\" width=\"900\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n<a id=\"features\"></a>\n\n## 🔒 Your files stay yours\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/folder.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Plain files on your machine.** Every change lands in your Git history.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/git.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Sync with coauthors through Git.** Pull, push, and let an agent resolve conflicts.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/code.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Free and open source.** MIT licensed, for macOS, Linux and Windows.\n\n<a id=\"agents\"></a>\n\n## 🤖 Bring the AI agent you already use\n\n<!-- BEGIN AGENT ICONS -->\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"docs/guide.md#agents\">\n    <picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/compact-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/desktop-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/compact.svg\">\n      <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/desktop.svg\" alt=\"Codex, Claude, Cursor, Copilot, Grok, Antigravity, Kimi, GLM, DeepSeek, Qwen, OpenCode\" width=\"816\">\n    </picture>\n  </a>\n</p>\n<!-- END AGENT ICONS -->\n\n<a id=\"downloads\"></a>\n\n## 📥 Downloads\n\n<!-- BEGIN DOWNLOADS -->\n| System / distribution | Download / package | Install / run |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/apple-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/apple.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> **macOS** | [Apple Silicon](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) · [Intel](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)<br>DMG / ZIP | Open the DMG and drag Papilot to Applications. |\n| <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/windows-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/windows.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> **Windows** | [Installer](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) · [Portable](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)<br>x64 | Run the installer or open the portable executable. |\n| <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/ubuntu.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/debian.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> **Ubuntu / Debian / Linux Mint** | [.deb](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) | `sudo apt install ./Papilot-*.deb` |\n| <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/linux-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/linux.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> **Fedora / Arch / openSUSE** | [AppImage](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) | `chmod +x Papilot-*.AppImage`<br>`./Papilot-*.AppImage` |\n| <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/nixos.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> **NixOS** | [Nix flake](docs/nix.md#nixos-flake) | [Add to your `flake.nix`](docs/nix.md#nixos-flake) |\n| **macOS / Linux / Windows (CLI)** | [npm](https://www.npmjs.com/package/papilot) | `npm install -g papilot` |\n\nLinux packages are x86_64 and tested on Ubuntu 22.04. See [desktop setup](desktop/README.md#build-and-run) for dependencies and AppImage/FUSE help.\n\nThe npm package opens the browser interface and requires Node.js 22.22+. Nix requires flakes; see [Nix setup](docs/nix.md#nixos-flake).\n<!-- END DOWNLOADS -->\n\n<a id=\"quick-start\"></a>\n\n## 🚀 Get started\n\n1. **Install.** [Download the app](#downloads) for macOS, Linux or Windows, or run `npm install -g papilot` (Node.js 22.22+). You also need Git and TeX Live or MacTeX.\n2. **Open your project.** Choose the folder with your `.tex` files. Papilot builds the PDF.\n3. **Pick an agent.** Use the CLI login or API key you already have, then mark up the page.\n\nWant a sample first? Run `papilot demo`. Details are in the [guide](docs/guide.md#install-and-run).\n\n<a id=\"documentation-and-community\"></a>\n\n## 🤝 Community\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/issue.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Found a bug or missing a feature?** [Open an issue](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/issues/new/choose), even a rough one.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/discussion.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Have a question or an idea?** [Start a discussion](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/discussions).\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/pull-request.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Become a contributor.** Pull requests are very welcome, including ones written with AI agents. Start with the [contributing guide](.github/CONTRIBUTING.md).\n\n## Contributors\n\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/graphs/contributors\">\n    <picture>\n      <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-contributors/compact.svg\">\n      <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-contributors/desktop.svg\" alt=\"Papilot's contributors\">\n    </picture>\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n## Star History\n\n<a href=\"https://www.star-history.com/?repos=papilotai%2Fpapilot&type=date&logscale=&legend=bottom-right\">\n <picture>\n   <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://api.star-history.com/chart?repos=papilotai/papilot&type=date&theme=dark&legend=bottom-right\" />\n   <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://api.star-history.com/chart?repos=papilotai/papilot&type=date&legend=bottom-right\" />\n   <img alt=\"Star History Chart\" src=\"https://api.star-history.com/chart?repos=papilotai/papilot&type=date&legend=bottom-right\" />\n </picture>\n</a>\n\n---\n\n<p align=\"center\"><sub><a href=\"LICENSE\">MIT</a> © 2026 PapilotAI. Thanks to our friends at <a href=\"https://linux.do/\">LINUX DO</a>.</sub></p>\n": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/wordmark.svg#gh-light-mode-only\" width=\"220\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Papilot\"><img src=\"docs/assets/wordmark-dark.svg#gh-dark-mode-only\" width=\"220\" height=\"69\" alt=\"Papilot\"><br>**Editor de LaTeX con IA de nueva generación**\n\n# No leas ni escribas `.tex`<br>Trabaja directamente sobre el <img src=\"docs/assets/pdf.svg\" width=\"34\" height=\"41\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"PDF\">\n\nUn **nuevo paradigma** para la escritura y composición tipográfica responsable con IA.\n\n<!-- BEGIN BADGES -->\n[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/github/license/PapilotAI/papilot?style=flat&color=22c55e)](LICENSE)\n[![CI](https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/PapilotAI/papilot/ci.yml?branch=main&style=flat&label=CI)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/actions/workflows/ci.yml)\n[![Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/PapilotAI/papilot?style=flat&label=release&color=0969da)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)\n[![GitHub total downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/PapilotAI/papilot/total?style=flat&logo=github&label=downloads&color=0969da)](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases)\n[![npm monthly downloads](https://img.shields.io/npm/dm/papilot?style=flat&logo=npm&label=downloads&color=cb3837)](https://www.npmjs.com/package/papilot)\n<!-- END BADGES -->\n\n<p data-language-switcher><sub><a href=\"README.md\">English</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.zh-CN.md\">简体中文</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.zh-Hant.md\">繁體中文</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.ja.md\">日本語</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.ko.md\">한국어</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.de.md\">Deutsch</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.fr.md\">Français</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.es.md\">Español</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.pt.md\">Português</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.it.md\">Italiano</a>&nbsp;· <a href=\"docs/readme/README.sv.md\">Svenska</a></sub></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://papilot.ai\">\n<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-compact-dark.png\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-dark.png\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero-compact.png\">\n  <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/hero.png\" alt=\"Papilot muestra una edición con IA como un antes y un después compuesto sobre el PDF, con las opciones Aceptar, Rechazar y Comentar.\" width=\"900\">\n</picture>\n</a>\n</p>\n\n## 📄 Lo que te importa es el PDF<br>No el `.tex` que hay detrás\n\nArtículos, tesis, libros, presentaciones: los lectores solo ven la página compuesta.<br>\n**Por eso la página también es donde deberías trabajar.**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-compact-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm-compact.png\">\n    <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/paradigm.png\" alt=\"Escribir LaTeX a mano, luego comprobar diffs de LaTeX de la IA y ahora Papilot: revisar el PDF.\" width=\"900\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n**Olvídate de compilar diferencias en tu cabeza.**<br>\nUn diff del código fuente te obliga a *imaginar* el PDF. Papilot te lo *muestra* directamente compuesto.\n\n## 👉 Señala en la página y di lo que quieres\n\nMarca una oración, una ecuación o una figura y escribe una anotación.<br>\n**Tu agente localiza el código fuente. Nunca tendrás que abrir un archivo `.tex`.**\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-compact-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-dark.png\">\n    <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app-compact.png\">\n    <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-showcase/notes-app.png\" alt=\"Papilot con un recuadro alrededor de una ecuación y una oración resaltada en el PDF, cada una con una anotación y ambas añadidas a la siguiente tarea.\" width=\"900\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n<a id=\"features\"></a>\n\n## 🔒 Tus archivos siguen siendo tuyos\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/folder.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Archivos simples en tu equipo.** Cada cambio queda registrado en tu historial de Git.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/git.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Sincroniza con coautores mediante Git.** Extrae cambios, súbelos y deja que un agente resuelva los conflictos.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/code.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Gratuito y de código abierto.** Bajo licencia MIT, para macOS, Linux y Windows.\n\n<a id=\"agents\"></a>\n\n## 🤖 Usa el agente de IA que ya utilizas\n\n<!-- BEGIN AGENT ICONS -->\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"docs/guide.md#agents\">\n    <picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/compact-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/desktop-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/compact.svg\">\n      <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-agents/desktop.svg\" alt=\"Codex, Claude, Cursor, Copilot, Grok, Antigravity, Kimi, GLM, DeepSeek, Qwen, OpenCode\" width=\"816\">\n    </picture>\n  </a>\n</p>\n<!-- END AGENT ICONS -->\n\n<a id=\"downloads\"></a>\n\n## 📥 Descargas\n\n<!-- BEGIN DOWNLOADS -->\n| Sistema / distribución | Descarga / paquete | Instalar / ejecutar |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/apple-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/apple.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> **macOS** | [Apple Silicon](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) · [Intel](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)<br>DMG / ZIP | Abre el DMG y arrastra Papilot a Aplicaciones. |\n| <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/windows-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/windows.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> **Windows** | [Instalador](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) · [Versión portable](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest)<br>x64 | Ejecuta el instalador o abre directamente la versión portable. |\n| <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/ubuntu.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/debian.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> **Ubuntu / Debian / Linux Mint** | [.deb](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) | `sudo apt install ./Papilot-*.deb` |\n| <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/linux-dark.svg\"><img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/linux.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> **Fedora / Arch / openSUSE** | [AppImage](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/releases/latest) | `chmod +x Papilot-*.AppImage`<br>`./Papilot-*.AppImage` |\n| <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/nixos.svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> **NixOS** | [Nix flake](docs/nix.md#nixos-flake) | [Añadir a tu `flake.nix`](docs/nix.md#nixos-flake) |\n| **macOS / Linux / Windows (CLI)** | [npm](https://www.npmjs.com/package/papilot) | `npm install -g papilot` |\n\nLos paquetes de Linux son para x86_64 y se han probado en Ubuntu 22.04. Consulta la [guía de escritorio](desktop/README.md#build-and-run) para las dependencias y la ayuda sobre AppImage/FUSE.\n\nEl paquete npm abre la interfaz en el navegador y requiere Node.js 22.22+. Nix requiere activar flakes; consulta la [guía de Nix](docs/nix.md#nixos-flake).\n<!-- END DOWNLOADS -->\n\n<a id=\"quick-start\"></a>\n\n## 🚀 Primeros pasos\n\n1. **Instalar.** [Descarga la aplicación](#downloads) para macOS, Linux o Windows, o ejecuta `npm install -g papilot` (Node.js 22.22+). También necesitarás Git y TeX Live o MacTeX.\n2. **Abrir tu proyecto.** Elige la carpeta con tus archivos `.tex`. Papilot compila el PDF.\n3. **Elegir un agente.** Usa el inicio de sesión por CLI o la clave de API que ya tengas y haz anotaciones en la página.\n\n¿Quieres probar primero con un ejemplo? Ejecuta `papilot demo`. Encontrarás los detalles en la [guía](docs/guide.md#install-and-run).\n\n<a id=\"documentation-and-community\"></a>\n\n## 🤝 Comunidad\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/issue.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**¿Has encontrado un error o echas en falta alguna función?** [Abre un issue](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/issues/new/choose), aunque sea un borrador.\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/discussion.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**¿Tienes una pregunta o una idea?** [Inicia un debate](https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/discussions).\n\n<img src=\"docs/assets/readme-icons/pull-request.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;**Conviértete en colaborador.** Los pull requests son muy bienvenidos, incluidos los redactados con agentes de IA. Empieza consultando la [guía de contribución](.github/CONTRIBUTING.md).\n\n## Colaboradores\n\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/PapilotAI/papilot/graphs/contributors\">\n    <picture>\n      <source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"docs/assets/readme-contributors/compact.svg\">\n      <img src=\"docs/assets/readme-contributors/desktop.svg\" alt=\"Colaboradores de Papilot\">\n    </picture>\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n## Historial de estrellas\n\n<a href=\"https://www.star-history.com/?repos=papilotai%2Fpapilot&type=date&logscale=&legend=bottom-right\">\n <picture>\n   <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://api.star-history.com/chart?repos=papilotai/papilot&type=date&theme=dark&legend=bottom-right\" />\n   <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://api.star-history.com/chart?repos=papilotai/papilot&type=date&legend=bottom-right\" />\n   <img alt=\"Gráfico del historial de estrellas\" src=\"https://api.star-history.com/chart?repos=papilotai/papilot&type=date&legend=bottom-right\" />\n </picture>\n</a>\n\n---\n\n<p align=\"center\"><sub><a href=\"LICENSE\">MIT</a> © 2026 PapilotAI. Gracias a nuestros amigos de <a href=\"https://linux.do/\">LINUX DO</a>.</sub></p>\n"
